 Andromeda","st":"A Symmetry of Imperfection","d":"When Rommie becomes too emotional, the ship cuts her access in order to run diagnostics. This leaves the ship vulnerable to a Magog attack.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Action"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/5ea2fb910fa6a5001a70d811/tile_1781206922445.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S04E19"},{"s":1795341600,"e":1795345200,"t":"Gene Roddenberry's Andromeda","st":"Time Out of Mind","d":"The Abyss kills Beka's friend, and the crew must figure out what information they killed for.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Action"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/5ea2fb910fa6a5001a70d811/tile_1781206922445.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S04E20"}]